{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "db4c5b60c4c080f6df4eba7cee77456263382c89d4aa114010fb3f35acfd5cfb", "ja": "いや、プチ不幸とか言われても……\nちゃんと説明しろって。", "zh": "不是，都说是小小的不幸了……\n你倒是好好解释一下啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "38d9e2ced13d3df34573c05ccb8d41e095f169cc314c9c739e628cc7d2f99ece", "ja": "だから、そのまんまの意味！　今のアタシは、ホントに\n危険だから……！　わ～！　こっち来ちゃダメだって！", "zh": "所以就是字面上的意思！现在的我，真的很危险……！哇～！都说了不许过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1002_p", "source_sha256": "33325fb161d8633ad8de76b8f1e6aea007ad86c798fe4720cdb96721afef8c72", "ja": "あの声は……歩とジュリアか？\n随分騒がしいけど、何かあったのかな？", "zh": "那个声音是……步和茱莉亚吗？\n好像闹得挺厉害的，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1003_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "986b5ea296806890c12273eab9ebfba9d2e9ce68a6e88fbf648b0db6479954cd", "ja": "やっほ！　お疲れー♪\nなになに、なんかあったカンジ？", "zh": "嗨！辛苦啦～♪\n怎么啦怎么啦，感觉好像发生了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "426834b7dc34a7bcfda501860359497ba61b10008a32dc090f639d279e46d135", "ja": "なんか、プチ不幸？とか\n聞こえたような……？", "zh": "我好像听到什么“有点不幸”之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "4adcca9b7654577d4a9ba6cdd2ef4816c6b754798887cb61d91b2413314a7898", "ja": "それがさ……歩がウチらに、\n「プチ不幸期間だから近づくな！」って言うんだよ。", "zh": "事情是这样的……步对我们说：“现在是小小不幸期，别靠近我！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "376bd2b6c121bea3ff3db9803b57df863dcf4d06d44f363fafe1c93a4bb298a6", "ja": "歩さんに近づいたら、\n私たちにもプチ不幸なことが起こるかもーって。", "zh": "要是接近步小姐，我们也可能遇上些小小的不幸哦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c00b2dce60d97fce4fc21b4681f472ee8f88c1d844709d67120187b8a5058232", "ja": "プチ不幸……？\n歩、一体どういう事だ？", "zh": "小小的不幸……？\n步，到底是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "80c92676e48b9ea591a089f7f19823abafd26bf0e5d8334e2e92ed4de265b434", "ja": "{$P$}……\nうぅ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0d6237681138ca78c465f2b3dadfa7d48be86704660cb6768bdec36549d47d10", "ja": "たまにあるんだよ、アタシ……。\nちっちゃな不幸が重なるっていうか、連続する時期が。", "zh": "我偶尔也会这样……\n该说是会有一段时间接二连三地遇上些小小的不幸吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "03352958cd60be7ec96e37472d419687e3ab76882d5e01cb951502818720dda6", "ja": "昨日なんて、お気に入りの服に思いっきり醤油\nこぼしちゃってさ。着替えて外出たら、雨に降られて！", "zh": "就说昨天吧，最喜欢的衣服上洒了一大滩酱油。换了衣服出门，又碰上下雨！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2fbcbfdcfa4b95c3445ae3eee1bb15d2aacd4e7ad9b3a23e49b3178e2286b6ce", "ja": "それで慌ててコンビニで傘買ったら、すぐ止んでさ！\nまあ、それだけならまだよかったんだけど……。", "zh": "结果我慌慌张张在便利店买了把伞，雨却立刻停了！  \n不过，要只是这样倒还好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1014_p", "source_sha256": "974eab85ead147eaa0ccfc0f763b228509d665a22e2af975266a2ccb455b95f7", "ja": "まだあるのか？", "zh": "还有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "28917b369954305dae05dbbb54c18aeccca0b8f179dbd6fe13a0f85f9f1ab521", "ja": "ここからが、一番の不幸なんだよ～！！！\nその後、ダンスのステージを観に行ったんだけど……。", "zh": "接下来才是最倒霉的事啊——！！！\n之后我去看了舞蹈演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ed50f9f6e2a9efe7ba2211e24366a270a69d521705a807931eac9a8e7035a9b1", "ja": "目当てのダンサーがケガで欠場になっちゃっててさ……\n思わず「マイガー！？」って叫んじゃったよ……。", "zh": "结果我想看的舞者因为受伤没法出场了……\n一不小心就喊了句“我的天！？”，真是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2530de5ac75bb39be97f4a75261c89e44d39c178b855a67ed5c6a708c048b4dc", "ja": "なるほど、そんな事が……。\nそれは残念だったな。", "zh": "原来发生了这种事啊……\n那还真是遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb63a6b454719fb63e323cee80c417057966d60991c3a66729c5088ed0c4c7b4", "ja": "うん……。だからさ、アタシのこのプチ不幸に、\nみんなを巻き込みたくないんだ。", "zh": "嗯……所以说，我不想让大家也被我这点小小的不幸牵连进来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "cb9ba5b9ee0e609e4c198fd459a54d41bfb7844c196bb15218a05cf55aa480fd", "ja": "うーん、そっかー。たしかに一個一個は小さくても、\n重なるとまた何かあるかも？って思っちゃうよね。", "zh": "嗯——这样啊。确实，虽说每一件都是小事，可一旦接二连三地发生，就会忍不住觉得“该不会又要出什么事吧？”对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "b45c9db9e0a2eb98ee395e01560cb3cc6bc357df6dfbd65ddd06791ad0b4dcfe", "ja": "すっごいわかります！　私も、\n3日連続でお醤油こぼしたことありますから！", "zh": "我特别能理解！我也曾经连续3天打翻过酱油呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ddf14ad75c369839e4917d6ebd920541afea77fa99d7cdeb77af97f49ee135c5", "ja": "どうしてちょっと自慢気なんだ……？\nいや、それなら朗報かもしれない。", "zh": "为什么还有点得意啊……？\n不，如果是那样的话，说不定是个好消息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5a85da55d4b91dc114a30e8c71a0c129a73aece1ee635afec0a575944e7ccafb", "ja": "早速、次の仕事の話を聞いてもらおうかな。\nきっと歩の気持ちも、少しは晴れると思うぞ！", "zh": "那我就赶紧跟你说说下一个工作的事吧。\n我想，步的心情一定也会稍微好一些！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0b28e674f74ecc38887abf95dcbdeff22bc7297ad225b3dd31e9593bba96611d", "ja": "えっ、なになに？\nどんな話？", "zh": "咦，什么什么？\n是什么工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ec88d02f3e7b10f33dcf8cf0da2a4f6baafaf8f64983765eddf5d2abf09d4491", "ja": "実は今度、海外の有名なダンスイベントが、\n初めて日本で開催されることになったんだ。", "zh": "其实下次，有一场海外知名的舞蹈活动，\n决定首次在日本举办了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1025_p", "source_sha256": "36a4420ad6b29b19f8743e6529a6585544bbfdb73abdd523b57d00a409f4d2c6", "ja": "といっても、ダンスの技術を競って一位を決める、\nいわゆるコンクール的なものじゃない。", "zh": "不过，这并不是那种通过比拼舞蹈技术来决出第一名，也就是所谓的舞蹈大赛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9cbc5d7832342427fc7fc36d23d06751683125bc998aacddc1c2a5c3c8e7fe54", "ja": "あくまでフェス、ダンスを観て楽しもうという\nイベントで、開催は沖縄を予定しているそうだ。", "zh": "说到底，这只是个看舞蹈、享受其中的活动，据说计划在冲绳举办。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "0e602325711b02b14186841bb0cf04d470c4d34df7397c1741de6efe6d789d74", "ja": "へーっ、沖縄！　いいじゃんいいじゃん！", "zh": "诶——冲绳！不错嘛不错嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1028_005yay", "source_sha256": "b17edc50601fffdadaceda470eccb0da85264de8c163ccde7c393be922421586", "ja": "沖縄、前に響さん、春香さんと\nお仕事で行って以来です！", "zh": "自从之前和响小姐、春香小姐一起去冲绳工作以来，我还是第一次来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1029_p", "source_sha256": "910631cde24fbbd3f7a628c08a042913fd38d4a2133e4f1c9029e04b4fa7d9c2", "ja": "歩なら知ってるんじゃないかな？\n『D.Fes』っていうイベントなんだけど……。", "zh": "小步应该知道吧？\n是叫作『D.Fes』的活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d6543506dc9743db95514843cf17de80dd0e18305210888f9a8a81891e961039", "ja": "えっ。それって、ストリート系のダンサーが\nいっぱい出演する、あの『D.Fes』！？", "zh": "诶？就是那个会有很多街舞舞者出演的『D.Fes』！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1031_p", "source_sha256": "cc121f5c73b47ba466c7a07d912e74881da6240c9167e78389eb7cf990b6264d", "ja": "やっぱり知ってたか。\nその『D.Fes』だよ。", "zh": "果然知道啊。\n就是你说的那个『D.Fes』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f1c530fa3ee051c0d6c56496a95a83186727d3607ee69f99d407be644c38e802", "ja": "マイガーッ！！　知ってるも何も、大好きだよ！\nアメリカにいる時、観に行ったことあるし！", "zh": "天哪——！！何止是知道，我最喜欢了！  \n我在美国的时候还去现场看过呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a469a0f8df2dab186940fd199fbccdea9a5018dd47263f7da2002ba35a3e59a1", "ja": "アメリカじゃ、ストリートダンサーの登竜門って\n言われてるくらい有名でさ……♪", "zh": "在美国可是有名到被称为街舞者的登龙门……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cbff1d57ec6c918f8ca6fbc6ce792c8064b1855b9200957f21043c91c7ece133", "ja": "って、その『D.Fes』にゲスト？\nあああ、アタシが！？", "zh": "等等，要去参加那个“D.Fes”当嘉宾？  \n啊啊啊，是我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "95bf9c0af16501b063fba9eb0d92d64d37285850b4c289014f880c7d648cf595", "ja": "{$P$}さん。そんなすごい\nイベントに、私たちが出ちゃっていいんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。这么厉害的\n活动，我们真的能去参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1036_p", "source_sha256": "852560d09f39a481cc2573f59a549fe78d6a83d86ae30a5356b1006b9b3f6a4a", "ja": "もちろん、ゲストだからな！　先方は、世界中の\nダンスカルチャーを色々リサーチしているらしい。", "zh": "当然，毕竟是作为嘉宾啊！听说对方\n正在对世界各地的舞蹈文化进行多方调研。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1037_p", "source_sha256": "e88a500ec97cdedb7b23f256605a6f0c38a767268b8b603d48b875b8c629b06c", "ja": "日本のダンスチームもいくつか出演するけど、\nうちはアイドル部門として……という感じだな。", "zh": "虽然也会有几支日本的舞蹈团队参加演出，但我们这边是作为偶像部门……大概就是这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1038_p", "source_sha256": "1decc82ab70335b3d000940dd6887eded6b3df764f875dc81e1010b75e19942c", "ja": "歩が言った通り、規模の大きいイベントだ。\n今回の出演は、かなり大きな話題になると思う！", "zh": "正如步所说，这是场规模很大的活动。\n我觉得这次出演一定会成为轰动性的话题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "5a1bff3cd60a67452a5ffd4813b5659bae1903cd7ce01a65f0269f1c2b3c1c53", "ja": "なるほど、歩のダンスを世界にアピールできる\nチャンスってことか。よかったな、歩！", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说这是个能向全世界展示步的舞蹈的机会。太好了，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1d9e915f8a6bb7ed6f3a24e9c199affac750cbd12b6370b165fc2ecf27512cdc", "ja": "うん……！　へこんでる場合じゃないよね！\nう～っ、テンション上がってきたー！", "zh": "嗯……！现在可不是垂头丧气的时候！\n呜～，情绪高涨起来啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1041_p", "source_sha256": "c641cee171aeefa2b4d216614923a949092f166190a664c74590ac8b94bfca69", "ja": "歩にはソロ曲も担当してもらうつもりだ。\nもちろん、他のみんなにも参加してもらうぞ！", "zh": "我打算也请舞负责一首独唱曲。\n当然，其他人也都会参加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "ffc664cae3bcf866d171e15d0189018a67e73d4967c07e5c05af07b7e45af517", "ja": "やったやった～♪　私、がんばりま～すっ！", "zh": "太棒了太棒了～♪　我、会加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1043_020meg", "source_sha256": "30b16b2d955a57713cdea7094cc50ff22a3d4d672a9ad32e77ce5a3701bf36d8", "ja": "うんうん♪　ここからはプチ不幸じゃなく、\nラッキーフィーバータイムにしちゃおうね、歩っ！", "zh": "嗯嗯♪ 从现在开始就别再遇到小小的不幸了，\n一起变成幸运大狂欢时间吧，小步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1044_005yay", "source_sha256": "3902f2dd903076e1eb8e0e4cbf2f64ea45c4dd05c199eca2ef5641e2b96a2c09", "ja": "楽しいステージにしましょうね、歩さん！", "zh": "一起打造快乐的舞台吧，步小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "42d72239651befbd9818c7e312c07654a8a5fb870a552a841c3bc9689170daff", "ja": "うん！　アタシなりに、全力を尽くしてみるよ……！\nみんな、よろしくっ！", "zh": "嗯！我会以自己的方式全力以赴的……！\n大家，请多关照啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_158_1046_p", "source_sha256": "4c232b940ca7cba1adf51a7699cd26ec898ba49c15a349903c4c2481bd566f61", "ja": "（どうにか歩の気持ちも晴れたみたいで、よかった。\nあとはイベント本番まで、レッスンするだけだな）", "zh": "（好歹步的心情好像也变好了，太好了。\n接下来只要在活动正式开始前继续练习就行了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
